  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhūgūji bo kūmalīja na būgīsha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū nalize koi, lūkūbiza lūkangala lo kadatū ū lwenūlū; būlī mhayo shiigelile goolechiwe na bakaanīji babīlī nūūlū badatū, hū gūmanīke ū būng'hana wago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamalile kūmuwīla, nī haha nūūlū īkī natīko koi, nalīhaya gīt'ūmo naalī naalekile nūmuwīla aho naalī nizile koi ū lūkangala lo kabīlī; nalībamanya ng'hana ng'hana abo bakwītaga shibi, pye na a bangī, gīkī ūlū nalize ī hangī, natikūmbīlījaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī mukūkoobaga shimanīkījo sha gīkī ū Kilisito akūyombaga kūbītīla mulī nene, managi gīkī, atī ngokolo na hado yaya ū kū bing'we, alīyo alī na būdūla ū mu bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana akakong'wa ha nsalaba mu būgokolo, alīyo ī haha alī mpanga kūlwa būdūla bo ng'wa Mulungu; hama īlī ng'hana gīkī ū mulī wei tūlī bagokolo, alīyo ū kū bing'we tūkūbiza bapanga hamò nang'hwe kūlwa būdūla bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igīsīlījagi bing'we benekīlī mubone ūlū mulīmo ū mu kūzunya; hamo mutamanile gīkī ū Kilisito alīmo ū mu bing'we? Numho jibize jimulemeelile ī nzīla jakwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nalisagīlwa mukūdeeba gīkī, a bise jitatūlemeelile ī nzīla jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha tūlīnomba ū Mulungu mutizīīta mhayo gose gose gwabūbi; ītī kūlwa gīkī a bise tūbonwe tūdūgije kūshimīzīla ū mu nzīla jakwe, alīyo a bing'we ītagi dūhū ī yawiza, nūūlū tūkabiza a bise gīkī jitūlemeelile ī nzīla jakwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bise tūtīko kwīta mhayo gose gose ūyo gwipūganije nayo ī ng'hana, tūkīītaga īyo yīmīīlile ha ng'hana dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūkūyega nūūlū tūgogoloha, shitange a bing'we mubize na būdūla; nīyo ū būlombi wise būlī gīkī mubize bashikanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene ī haha aho natīko koi nalīng'wandīkīla ī mihayo yenīyī, gīkī ūlū nalize natizūbūtūmamīla mu būkalī ū būdūla ūbo Seeba waninha; nguno waninha kūlwa kūzenga, ītī kūsambagūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwa kūmalīja bang'wise ikalagi mhola, ikondelagi, nīyo ng'wihūgūla; bizagi na būsangī ū mu maganiko, na mubize banhū ba mhola. Ū Mulungu wa būtogwa na mhola akūbiza hamò ning'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igīshagi bing'we kū bing'we mu kwibbipa kwela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a beela balīmugīsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shigongo sha ng'wa Seeba Yesu Kilisito, nū būtogwa bo ng'wa Mulungu, hamò nū būsangī bo ng'wa Moyo Ng'wela, shibize hamò ning'we bose: Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
